Hi all,<br>first of all thx for sharing opengd77. I made my first qso via the ISS with my Retevis RT3S! Working great.<br><br>Got now opengd77 installed on my v5 TYT-MD9600 latest test firmware 20250323. All up and running. When I send a aprs beacon in the air via the normal local aprs Vhf freq I see the 'message' is arriving at the aprs rx station.<br><br>When I send a aprs beacon via a satellite (ISS or Sonate-2) I think to see that only the position is send and not a message.<br>Can I add a aprs 'message' to the satellites.txt file, and if "yes you can"; How to configure this?<br><br>Many thx and 73's<br>PD2CH<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8499">PD2CH</a> — Thu May 29, 2025 9:05 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
